{"orgCode":"1700","name":"Civil Rights Department","agencyCode":"2000","agencyName":"Housing and Homelessness","description":"The Civil Rights Department (CRD) is responsible for protecting the civil rights of the people of California. CRD receives, investigates, conciliates, mediates, and prosecutes complaints alleging unlawful discrimination and other civil rights violations in employment, housing, public accommodations, business, and state-funded programs and activities, as well as acts of hate violence and human trafficking. CRD is authorized to prosecute cases directly in court and to seek attorney's fees and costs when it is the prevailing party. CRD's jurisdiction extends to individuals, employers, housing providers, private and public entities, business establishments, and state-funded programs and activities within California. The Civil Rights Council (Council), within CRD, promulgates regulations to interpret California's civil rights laws and holds informational civil rights hearings. CRD also conducts outreach and education and operates a pay data reporting program, the Commission on the State of Hate, and other strategic initiatives to prevent and remedy discrimination and other unlawful conduct.","totals":{"amounts":{"py":64715,"cy":77964,"by":69613},"positions":{"py":335.1,"cy":342.3,"by":387.3}},"programs":{"id":"exp/2000/1700","kind":"department","name":"Civil Rights Department","code":"1700","amounts":{"py":64715,"cy":77964,"by":69613},"positions":{"py":335.1,"cy":342.3,"by":387.3},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":48873,"cy":71348,"by":63364},"special":{"py":9766,"cy":493,"by":493},"federal":{"py":6076,"cy":6123,"by":5756}},"children":[{"id":"exp/2000/1700/1490","kind":"program","name":"Administration of Civil Rights Law","code":"1490","amounts":{"py":64065,"cy":77314,"by":68963},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":48223,"cy":70698,"by":62714},"special":{"py":9766,"cy":493,"by":493},"federal":{"py":6076,"cy":6123,"by":5756}},"positions":{"py":334,"cy":341.3,"by":386.3},"description":"1490 - ADMINISTRATION OF CIVIL RIGHTS LAW\n\nThrough this program, CRD oversees both private and public entities operating within California. CRD promotes equal opportunity and works to eliminate discrimination and other civil rights violations in employment, housing, public accommodations, business, and state-funded programs and activities. Additionally, CRD conducts outreach and education and operates a pay data reporting program, the Commission on the State of Hate, and other strategic initiatives to prevent and remedy discrimination and other unlawful conduct.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":64065,"cy":77314,"by":68963}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/2000/1700/1490/f0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":48223,"cy":70698,"by":62714},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":48223,"cy":70698,"by":62714}},"extra":{"fundType":"general","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":48223,"cy":70698,"by":62714}}}},{"id":"exp/2000/1700/1490/f0890","kind":"fund","name":"Federal Trust Fund","code":"0890","amounts":{"py":6076,"cy":6123,"by":5756},"byFundType":{"federal":{"py":6076,"cy":6123,"by":5756}},"extra":{"fundType":"federal","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":6076,"cy":6123,"by":5756}}}},{"id":"exp/2000/1700/1490/f3246","kind":"fund","name":"Civil Rights Enforcement and Litigation Fund","code":"3246","amounts":{"py":9766,"cy":493,"by":493},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":9766,"cy":493,"by":493}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":9766,"cy":493,"by":493}}}}]},{"id":"exp/2000/1700/1495","kind":"program","name":"Civil Rights Council","code":"1495","amounts":{"py":221,"cy":221,"by":221},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":221,"cy":221,"by":221}},"positions":{"py":1.1,"cy":1,"by":1},"description":"1495 - CIVIL RIGHTS COUNCIL\n\nThe Council promulgates rules and regulations and holds public hearings on civil rights issues.","extra"